# API Configuration
# Locally, the frontend calls the backend directly.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5258

# In Vercel (staging/production) project settings, leave NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
# unset entirely (Vercel won't persist an empty-string value anyway) and
# instead set:
#   BACKEND_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com   (server-side only, used by the
#                                                         rewrite proxy in next.config.ts)
# This keeps the auth cookie first-party so it isn't blocked by iOS WebKit's
# Intelligent Tracking Prevention (see next.config.ts for details).
